{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q639258","formula":"Cu₃(TeO₄)(OH)₄","hill":"Cu3H4O8Te","elements":["H","O","Cu","Te"],"composition":{"H":4.0,"O":8.0,"Cu":3.0,"Te":1.0},"names":{"en":"Xocomecatlite","uk":"Ксокомекатліт"},"descriptions":{"en":"Xocomecatlite is a rare tellurate mineral with formula: Cu3(TeO4)(OH)4. It is an orthorhombic mineral which occurs as aggregates or spherules of green needlelike crystals. It was first described in 1975 for an occurrence in the Oriental mine near Moctezuma, Sonora, Mexico.","uk":"Ксокомекатліт — рідкісний мінерал-телурат з формулою Cu3(ТеО4)(ОН)4. Це орторомбічний мінерал, який зустрічається у вигляді агрегатів або сферул із зелених голкоподібних кристалів. Вперше цей мінерал був описаний у 1975 р."},"fame":11,"pubchemCid":null,"mass":null,"charge":0,"smiles":null,"inchikey":null,"iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q12089225","names":{"en":"mineral species","ru":"действительный вид минералов","uk":"мінеральний вид"}}],"structureInfo":null,"structure":null,"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q639258","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xocomecatlite","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (uk)","url":"https://uk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9A%D1%81%D0%BE%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%B5%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%BB%D1%96%D1%82","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"photo","name":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Xocomecatlite-616338.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}],"similar":[{"id":"Q3665592","formula":"Cu₃TeO₄(OH)₄","names":{"en":"Cesbronite"},"elements":["H","O","Cu","Te"],"fame":7,"kind":null},{"id":"Q3807936","formula":"Cu₃TeO₆(H₂O)₂","names":{"en":"Jensenite","uk":"Дженсеніт"},"elements":["H","O","Cu","Te"],"fame":5,"kind":null},{"id":"Q429705","formula":"BiCu₆(AsO₄)₃(OH)₆*3H₂O","names":{"en":"Mixite"},"elements":["H","O","Cu","As","Bi"],"fame":13,"kind":null},{"id":"Q1065100